23949275486183_1726980225355620208_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ySSgEQINO6IQ7kNvwEfY-IG&_nc_oc=AdqOKEg0CvFRv8FwRfQGWW_KmnIilH4hJijoEFdQVyoMt3yUFgABcGDQ2AQ1Kyfhv4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8mQMkfLUDUWUF_lC_AAaksVmiKuFwsv0x7vnkezPpy_Q&oe=6A2197CE"}, {"file_name": "JN-Main Keyart-4.png", "id": "1641848650682625", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_1641848654015958_3875810096169971529_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mIaZbl0WpzAQ7kNvwFS7AWW&_nc_oc=AdoWn8lBhA9VhZ9ddQCFAPW7G7ABpiUfXPKJV7n1H_yFF7GtPzB5HhWdbvhPiMg-T-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_DRjKX3ElZE6F-WGy_CkB-GGCEcHb70pyo5o2PWD2nVw&oe=6A21A0F1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JN_Store_Keyart_Main.png", "id": "2690203768041294", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622919_2690203771374627_8045612763508620258_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nmuSpGdDl4AQ7kNvwGgYY11&_nc_oc=AdrmAF9d7snBb1z78gR7O25CHMTOLPuctui-zQMUjn5_NQWj4nSfT-HywTtAJoNUyvM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9q1jpLf05Og7D8FfyI0IgDP9h77rFq_TP32Jh1Z9iPSA&oe=6A21975E"}, "display_name": "Jigsaw Night", "keywords": ["jigsaw", "puzzle", "multiplayer", "puzzles", "family"], "long_description": "# Awarded Best Hand Tracking Game of 2025 from UploadVR\n\nJigsaw Night is a shared VR puzzle experience that brings people together one piece at a time. Play alone or with the people you love. Bring up to six people, in the same room or anywhere in the world.\n\n**PICK UP AND PLAY**\n\nThe easiest way to introduce someone to VR or mixed reality. Find matching puzzle pieces and snap them together. Use controllers or hand tracking, designed to feel real and natural.\n\n{979554604682010}\n\n**PLAY TOGETHER**\n\nBuild together in the same room with one-touch multiplayer, or connect online. Perfect for family game night or catching up with friends. Avatars and voice chat make it feel like they're right there with you.\n{1352074333646830}\n\n**MAKE IT YOURS**\n\nTurn any photo from your Facebook albums into a puzzle no one else has. Your dog, last summer's trip, the photo from 2014 you forgot you had. Build old memories and make new ones together.\n{2189416908519141}\n\n\n# GAME FEATURES\n\n- Puzzle Library: curated images included.\n- Puzzle Builder: customize piece count, style, and double-sided puzzles.\n- Hand Tracking & Controllers: use either or both, switch any time.\n- Single and Multiplayer Support: play solo or build together.\n- Co-Location: for players in the same room.\n- Co-Presence: for players across the world. \n- Facebook Integration: connect your account and upload your own photos.\n- Capture & Streaming: take 4K photos, record HD video, or live stream to Twitch or YouTube. Powered by LIV.\n- Cross-Platform Companion Apps: more ways to play, coming soon.\n\n{1012707434662661}", "short_description": "Awarded Best Hand Tracking Game of 2025 from UploadVR\n\nJigsaw Night is a shared VR puzzle experience that brings people together one piece at a time. Play alone or with the people you love. Bring up to six people, in the same room or anywhere in the world."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://jigsawnight.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://jigsawnight.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "ContractXR Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.jigsawnight.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "rec